{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/s8mnje7pdmtph20lntddkdwi42mbo56.mp3","text":"博士，需要我做什么吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/qevtextqhd6mucuzl0cwe5k8ew3k15b.mp3","text":"博士，你好像总是在工作的样子，你平时没有什么爱好吗？我的话，我喜欢找一些冷门的老电影看。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/rn1xuxp8a1wehzheq0w5aucepzeijdh.mp3","text":"我会学习战斗技巧，其实是因为小时候看了一部电影，里面的主角就是用匕首和自制陷阱战斗的，我当时觉得很帅，就开始学了起来。这些匕首，其实也是电影主角使用的同款。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/iegd3dw76u1hluyua8nots8p1knhxj5.mp3","text":"在哥伦比亚，什么都可以用钱买到，这听起来很好，但反过来说，就是没有钱什么都无法得到。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/qfuutzzbzl5noygprtq4cjlcesrynrc.mp3","text":"感觉罗德岛很像那些电影里的公司呢，表面是医药公司，私下却是佣兵集团，行动的目的是为了拯救更多的人......感觉，好帅。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/fxxzfkarejif4sd9kow0jz5a8pqa4u3.mp3","text":"博士，我给人的感觉会不会有些阴沉？......唔，自从爸爸变成那样后，我就不得不去考虑家计的事，其实我以前不是这样的性格的，哈......","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/1ua6dmuk6rlv5jeidomyjbhkw6c06hb.mp3","text":"我不恨安东尼，过去的事一定要说的话，我觉得爸爸也有责任。而且其实我很感谢他，如果不是他，我大概已经做出无法挽回的事了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/7tuh84hiuxb4d07uk75h6wmpbejqu0y.mp3","text":"爸爸永远都不明白，妈妈离开他不是因为家里没钱了，而是他的性格越来越暴躁了。我也想过跟妈妈一起走，但爸爸以前......对我很好的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/6frmjq6krxyfs6h1fu0orjesno4xyyv.mp3","text":"跟在博士身边有时候会因为太过放松而让我忘记了自己的事，虽然现在有钱给爸爸治病了，但是爸爸的心病光靠我可能是无法治愈的......博士，可以帮帮我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/j2bolsuiphi3vdeb41bk8tvodk8l3or.mp3","text":"博士也是累了就会直接就地休息的人呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/i41pdx3cmk7kfhtdnhi2a4m4e9c8w62.mp3","text":"你好，博士，我是新加入的干员，请叫我罗宾就好。我很缺钱，所以如果不嫌弃的话，请尽管差遣我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/mar7cfmcttc8vpy70ca23gif808ciq8.mp3","text":"好厉害，感觉像在看动作片一样......","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/sosj5wrfcrixdwhppggn1zjpucb7hw5.mp3","text":"咦，这么快就涨薪了吗......太好了，谢谢博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/dyy6vjn0h8lxkq6ssay2c0exhe3b2mg.mp3","text":"我过去的工作都没有持续很久，要么是公司自己有问题，要么是爸爸出事了......这一次，感觉能在罗德岛待很久。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/mxhms9pegj5pusd2bt04js2o50x6dj7.mp3","text":"交给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/evyf8vxkb839ckxvhfzuruj7b1y07ax.mp3","text":"我不太擅长团队协作......","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/0up6abn859m7z88ykz1bgst9c9sn31r.mp3","text":"这次会去什么样的地方呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/65sx6b6m6y3otuoasoqbdplxhhoq1du.mp3","text":"先观察一下环境......","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/c5s8b0icabhbf1kwbejy8k5r6c1zkyf.mp3","text":"到我了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/49co8iwn4vzjpl4561atizrbbcs1nsw.mp3","text":"我准备好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/10hcplzgjpcjlqkl2u47uko2majdyin.mp3","text":"看到敌人了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/lqr7yzqxvl3mq029ceajnvtcgok5yqg.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/bzy2e58cl18wr3brevir8jwakmau9nd.mp3","text":"我也是有脾气的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/gwekb62u69zicmiqm3rrn483bir8no5.mp3","text":"嘿呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/2euyu050qgs8mc9vvppjos8keygc4my.mp3","text":"你们在看哪里呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/osyhy4ivnfelkrp0gctf809qf79twnh.mp3","text":"我的武器可不止匕首！","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/ldevhdbl5un3flzd0q64qfyncq0etkf.mp3","text":"博士，这样的任务能少一点吗，对心脏不好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/gfani80hw2ggmmao0ylped51shlsjqy.mp3","text":"有博士这样的上司应该是很多人梦寐以求的事情吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/i43iibjw801iyxorsicse05dt48znsm.mp3","text":"博士，需要我去追吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/fgh0uwllredwbc79gqchvwalct1ogzp.mp3","text":"博士，你先走，我来掩护你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/p8esjmr89xf1pzv85s6p8hod2aikwya.mp3","text":"熟悉一下环境吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/lhrfus9vh3aoyeplv2qx4u90du5sm5e.mp3","text":"诶诶？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/8myz96ebtmqlpxqwi7yb5de3ztg8uij.mp3","text":"博士，你在散步吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/4dqxkfc4ry1t8uiirec6slqy2p6fkcb.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/reg0upnzsx9nemnusxlkfarmwav9r1i.mp3","text":"“今天最开心的，是要与过去告别；今天最难过的，是要与回忆告别”，这句，是台词......博士，新年快乐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/7l09piy95mkrufk58fj0w6kyf4s671n.mp3","text":"博士，今天需要我护卫吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_451_robin/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/ffs33pj1s2bceo0855jh7hq3ve1357b.mp3","text":"博士，需要我做什么吗？","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/g5j8vzh6399yonox0pzy2fw0eovzbwe.mp3","text":"博士，你好像总是在工作的样子，你平时没有什么爱好吗？我的话，我喜欢找一些冷门的老电影看。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/4mupfx5pjkn54dndmgh822cedxd7mzx.mp3","text":"我会学习战斗技巧，其实是因为小时候看了一部电影，里面的主角就是用匕首和自制陷阱战斗的，我当时觉得很帅，就开始学了起来。这些匕首，其实也是电影主角使用的同款。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/d27a366wc1eu797sexezatzyjqahysq.mp3","text":"在哥伦比亚，什么都可以用钱买到，这听起来很好，但反过来说，就是没有钱什么都无法得到。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/0lti6haaa2zrshyogcgwxgb67jeyb9x.mp3","text":"感觉罗德岛很像那些电影里的公司呢，表面是医药公司，私下却是佣兵集团，行动的目的是为了拯救更多的人......感觉，好帅。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/2uz25tddbqxold4rp448g60brkxpk7n.mp3","text":"博士，我给人的感觉会不会有些阴沉？......唔，自从爸爸变成那样后，我就不得不去考虑家计的事，其实我以前不是这样的性格的，哈......","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/18qj7plit0gzxrc0efzvg18yj7jlxhe.mp3","text":"我不恨安东尼，过去的事一定要说的话，我觉得爸爸也有责任。而且其实我很感谢他，如果不是他，我大概已经做出无法挽回的事了。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/hvf40a0e9uzvk6grwpk3743aqci6nrj.mp3","text":"爸爸永远都不明白，妈妈离开他不是因为家里没钱了，而是他的性格越来越暴躁了。我也想过跟妈妈一起走，但爸爸以前......对我很好的。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/ht3i2s3anfjopwh4muoz0hb54g3l3fm.mp3","text":"跟在博士身边有时候会因为太过放松而让我忘记了自己的事，虽然现在有钱给爸爸治病了，但是爸爸的心病光靠我可能是无法治愈的......博士，可以帮帮我吗？","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/9u0tedc7mnhfh9vnnc1uzvc7wm7190p.mp3","text":"博士也是累了就会直接就地休息的人呢......","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/quqapue2lemdn0enzlbxifyrwncg4km.mp3","text":"你好，博士，我是新加入的干员，请叫我罗宾就好。我很缺钱，所以如果不嫌弃的话，请尽管差遣我吧。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/7zdtiskpjnwsyku8ewgp6oqhzrp083e.mp3","text":"好厉害，感觉像在看动作片一样......","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/fdp5nki4ygdxv2af077ncvrba01b0ba.mp3","text":"咦，这么快就涨薪了吗......太好了，谢谢博士！","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/n4mggcgxpf5w3bxflq2mj0fusprn6at.mp3","text":"我过去的工作都没有持续很久，要么是公司自己有问题，要么是爸爸出事了......这一次，感觉能在罗德岛待很久。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/ioex66n0ej15xiaskumehuqu6tnw4zx.mp3","text":"交给我吧。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/n53ylr7fo3147twkew35vqdleq8jkcm.mp3","text":"我不太擅长团队协作......","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/4r4bseivtejymlnj5tkavxwlaib7hpr.mp3","text":"这次会去什么样的地方呢。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/9z7vfwbaiqic7ljfd6esq7rec8ans1r.mp3","text":"先观察一下环境......","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/d2yofyzb7oj41hktotaqrbrye8zqxqh.mp3","text":"到我了吗？","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/08/des4bbb5gfqwo9kz3ks8wev7sc3wsbp.mp3","text":"我准备好了。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/2wnn4cb2zg9utb5cc3xiowt1lhrieso.mp3","text":"看到敌人了。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/fqbt9bvawgdp3xh4210tkd18q2vhwzo.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/pjgpqjysolkdl2fmqfa4vymc4qfbr64.mp3","text":"我也是有脾气的！","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/qhrop09p7901bq9o8ne2nujg7nlfyrk.mp3","text":"嘿呀！","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/i3hib0jzqyyk8x652cdbek6tvrql450.mp3","text":"你们在看哪里呢。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/b6a59fnqgh5ycteqwysnm8j1znbw11y.mp3","text":"我的武器可不止匕首！","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/dnea2i245dw3fis4x3lhtbprg1yhf68.mp3","text":"博士，这样的任务能少一点吗，对心脏不好......","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/3ju36ts4yip9fwghqpq71o588pweijv.mp3","text":"有博士这样的上司应该是很多人梦寐以求的事情吧。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/kj1mtp4yhqhg0wwirern3kahk3nnngf.mp3","text":"博士，需要我去追吗？","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/b0b86wndiy85wvezt5sw2ipd1jnvwl2.mp3","text":"博士，你先走，我来掩护你！","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/e3t7kdsmgpgp675l41odkyz4dgnrtu5.mp3","text":"熟悉一下环境吧。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/1uv0y5n8k70cirl8yizfjetdxk8jfxp.mp3","text":"诶诶？","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/1rotk7bpmp8skhmqhuh5ze0b27oxy81.mp3","text":"博士，你在散步吗？","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/a623yj4egapdj3pgyghtsclhdbxkuw6.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/oejjk7pigstsgfnnpuc6wo304488fbv.mp3","text":"“今天最开心的，是要与过去告别；今天最难过的，是要与回忆告别”，这句，是台词......博士，新年快乐。","alt":"voice/char_451_robin/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/17rakxev47do3i4tx